---
description: Keep live settings and the SQLite database off git
alwaysApply: true
---

# Do not commit settings or SQLite

Live files hold customer records and secrets. Do not stage or push them:

- `config/*.json` (copy from `config.example/` on a new install)
- `storage/database/*.sqlite` and any backup copy
- `storage/attachments/`

`config.example/` and `storage/database/shared_schema.sql` stay in git. A new install creates the database from the setup page.
